    <string name="guide_title">Game Guide &amp; Rules</string>
    <string name="guide_content">WELCOME TO BLINDSTORY!\n\n1. GAME CONCEPT\nBlindStory is a multiplayer game where players write a story together. The twist? Each player sees ONLY the previous single phrase written by the last player!\n\n2. GETTING STARTED\n- Language: Select interface language (English, Russian, Hebrew, Lithuanian).\n- Auth: Register or login with Email or Google to save your stories.\n\n3. CREATING &amp; JOINING ROOMS\n- Host creates a room with a topic, starting phrase, rounds (1-3), and turn time limit.\n- Share the 6-character room code (e.g. KOT123) with friends.\n- A minimum of 3 players is required to start the game.\n\n4. HOW TO PLAY\n- Read only the previous phrase ("sheet of paper" principle).\n- Write your continuation (2 to 180 characters).\n- Submit your phrase within the 60-second turn limit.\n- If needed, propose ending the game or skip your turn.\n\n5. FINAL &amp; AI COMMENTATOR\n- When rounds end, the full story is revealed with author credits under each sentence.\n- React with emojis (😂, 😮, 🔥, ❤️).\n- Click "What will AI say" for AI-generated titles, summary, funniest moment, unexpected twist, coherence score, and moral!</string>
